  "title": [
    "[Wyrdeep Forest, Clearing]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "The meandering path that leads farther into the forest grows increasingly difficult to navigate, dead leaves and broken twigs forming a protective cover over the almost concealed pathway.  Crisp snaps and crackles burst noisily from the surrounding woods in an unsettling cacophony.  Toward the east, a small clearing draws attention, a visual distraction from the hypnotic calls of the forest."
  ],
